				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/bafkreif4d7wtmzqppbpnwhjulf3d36ltbeg5wzu3i2mhq6wxb4f6nh5uo4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:18:45.576Z",
			"content": "<p>the core web vitals folk I think would very strongly suggest that lab data could be misleading compared to data from actual users</p>\n<p>... which is why it's currently so de-prioritised (I got some very helpful advice from <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt\">@tunetheweb.com</a> before launching)</p>\n<p>do you have a different point of view?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lollzvym322m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lollonj2es2c",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev/post/3lollzvym322m",
			"author": {
				"name": "daniel r(ooooooh) in nyc 🇺🇸",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/bafkreif4d7wtmzqppbpnwhjulf3d36ltbeg5wzu3i2mhq6wxb4f6nh5uo4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:25:03.573Z",
			"content": "<p>I should say though that any _mistakes_ in presenting the data are not barry's but mine 🙈</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:kpfpurt6ip57zesfmiu7gpr3/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolm2ol6xs2u",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tjallingt.com/post/3lolm2ol6xs2u",
			"author": {
				"name": "tjallingt",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tjallingt.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kpfpurt6ip57zesfmiu7gpr3/bafkreia745tlpi6wdmv7ayh35ichwwyknvhxgkxj7hpjwdnt7qqzsvakby"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:25:29.347Z",
			"content": "<p>interesting, the performance score is a 89 for me?<br>\n<a href=\"https://page-speed.dev/nextjs.org\">page-speed.dev/nextjs.org</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolmxquccc2j",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lollonj2es2c",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com/post/3lolmxquccc2j",
			"author": {
				"name": "Barry Pollard",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/bafkreibuvkjedijpuyongathjpsslib3hz6hf5fh3gbydrfvtiqeqtiuwe"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:41:44.821Z",
			"content": "<p>Yup and I stand by that advice. What users actually experience is what matters—not what some Lighthouse simulation thinks they might experience.</p>\n<p>And if a site happens to be visited by users of slightly better devices or network, then lucky for them! And I'd argue Next's site probably fits that.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3loln4bepqk2j",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolmxquccc2j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com/post/3loln4bepqk2j",
			"author": {
				"name": "Barry Pollard",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/bafkreibuvkjedijpuyongathjpsslib3hz6hf5fh3gbydrfvtiqeqtiuwe"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:44:16.354Z",
			"content": "<p>Of course there's always the risk that real users are abandoning a poorly performance site before CWV can even be recorded, but that's also difficult to measure accurately. And IMHO that would still be reflected in field metrics (even if not fully).</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolncq33vk2j",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3loln4bepqk2j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com/post/3lolncq33vk2j",
			"author": {
				"name": "Barry Pollard",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/bafkreibuvkjedijpuyongathjpsslib3hz6hf5fh3gbydrfvtiqeqtiuwe"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:47:53.094Z",
			"content": "<p>I also get a much higher score (85) on <a href=\"https://Nextjs.org\">Nextjs.org</a> when I test on PSI: <a href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/https-nextjs-org/91k0ip3beq?form_factor=mobile\">pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/htt...</a>, showing the variability in lab scores.</p>\n<p>Plus I know the Next people DO prioritise performance on their site. I mean there's plenty of JS-heavy bad examples out there but this is not one IMHO.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolnsyvmys26",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolncq33vk2j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lolnsyvmys26",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T14:56:59.224Z",
			"content": "<p>Sure — imo Core Web Vitals measures on two axes: performance versus the relative wealth of its visitors (via the hardware they use).</p>\n<p>You can’t use Core Web Vitals to compare the performance of two separate web sites — only Lab Data can do that — so scorecards like this are quite leaky</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolo5akgoc2v",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolnsyvmys26",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev/post/3lolo5akgoc2v",
			"author": {
				"name": "daniel r(ooooooh) in nyc 🇺🇸",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/bafkreif4d7wtmzqppbpnwhjulf3d36ltbeg5wzu3i2mhq6wxb4f6nh5uo4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:02:42.790Z",
			"content": "<p>agreed, I don't think this is for 'comparison' vs other sites so much as 'how well am I doing at creating a performant site for my users'</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolod2i7as2o",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolo5akgoc2v",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lolod2i7as2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:05:57.752Z",
			"content": "<p>yeah — right on. I’m glad you included the lab data on the page! I think both are important!</p>\n<p>I’m curious why this result was lab-data first? <a href=\"https://page-speed.dev/fedidb.com\">page-speed.dev/fedidb.com</a> via <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev/post/3lolkdd3zpk2u\">bsky.app/profile/dani...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3loloeuavhc2c",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolod2i7as2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com/post/3loloeuavhc2c",
			"author": {
				"name": "Barry Pollard",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/bafkreibuvkjedijpuyongathjpsslib3hz6hf5fh3gbydrfvtiqeqtiuwe"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:06:58.327Z",
			"content": "<p>No field data available:<br>\n<a href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/https-fedidb-com/n7uxc7na36?form_factor=mobile\">pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/htt...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolofohkek2l",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolod2i7as2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev/post/3lolofohkek2l",
			"author": {
				"name": "daniel r(ooooooh) in nyc 🇺🇸",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/bafkreif4d7wtmzqppbpnwhjulf3d36ltbeg5wzu3i2mhq6wxb4f6nh5uo4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:07:25.810Z",
			"content": "<p>this is lab-data first because it hasn't been up long enough to get CRuX data ...</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolonkrcps2o",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolofohkek2l",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lolonkrcps2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:11:50.371Z",
			"content": "<p>ah I see — how about that design treatment for lab data when field data is available too? 😅</p>\n<p>Regardless, a good discussion about how field data can be misleading too!</p>\n<p>For other folks that might want more info, I did write a little bit about this here: <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/lighthouse-deception/#lab-data-versus-field-data\">www.zachleat.com/web/lighthou...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3loloo3kqxk2l",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolo5akgoc2v",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev/post/3loloo3kqxk2l",
			"author": {
				"name": "daniel r(ooooooh) in nyc 🇺🇸",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/bafkreif4d7wtmzqppbpnwhjulf3d36ltbeg5wzu3i2mhq6wxb4f6nh5uo4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:12:07.981Z",
			"content": "<p>in general I couldn't be more opposed to weaponising open data like this in 'framework wars'</p>\n<p>(or indeed, against framework wars in general)</p>\n<p>this always needs to be about pushing ourselves to be better.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolotnkqh22k",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3loloo3kqxk2l",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lolotnkqh22k",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:15:14.629Z",
			"content": "<p>I wouldn’t say that it’s an exercise is weaponizing data — it’s more about having a stable baseline from which we can have performance discussions — we need more objective truth, not metrics that are wiggle-word friendly</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolovq5zmk24",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolonkrcps2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com/post/3lolovq5zmk24",
			"author": {
				"name": "Barry Pollard",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tunetheweb.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ilj6i6evo5xxl5iixp2y76nt/bafkreibuvkjedijpuyongathjpsslib3hz6hf5fh3gbydrfvtiqeqtiuwe"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:16:24.466Z",
			"content": "<p>Arguably lab is more comparable if wanting to do that on a pure like for like comparison. But is it right to do that? A plain text page will beat a complex web app in such a perf score but to what end?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolovx2efk2c",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolotnkqh22k",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev/post/3lolovx2efk2c",
			"author": {
				"name": "daniel r(ooooooh) in nyc 🇺🇸",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/danielroe.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/bafkreif4d7wtmzqppbpnwhjulf3d36ltbeg5wzu3i2mhq6wxb4f6nh5uo4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:16:31.687Z",
			"content": "<p>no, not you!</p>\n<p>I have seen it happen though.</p>\n<p>comparison between frameworks on the basis of sites using them is always tricky because there are always other factors:</p>\n<p>- type of site (app vs marketing vs personal)<br>\n- third party scripts<br>\n- business choices about what to prioritise</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolp7zffhc2o",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:jbeaa5kdaladzwq3r7f5xgwe/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolovx2efk2c",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lolp7zffhc2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T15:22:09.690Z",
			"content": "<p>ah, for sure — I remember the Astro blog post 😅</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolsu7yo3k22",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolnsyvmys26",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scottjehl.com/post/3lolsu7yo3k22",
			"author": {
				"name": "Scott Jehl",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scottjehl.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/bafkreicwirkhki6y6iujb4eszhob5bfr3plqwlksspvfunewlv7p6djwwi"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T16:27:08.925Z",
			"content": "<p>One benefit of lab metrics that I feel is underrated and under-discussed is the ability to understand how a site performs for devices/regions/etc that are not in its current user base. Valuable for anyone interested in broadening their reach.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/app.bsky.feed.post/3loltk3x62222",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolsu7yo3k22",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scottjehl.com/post/3loltk3x62222",
			"author": {
				"name": "Scott Jehl",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scottjehl.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/bafkreicwirkhki6y6iujb4eszhob5bfr3plqwlksspvfunewlv7p6djwwi"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T16:39:22.879Z",
			"content": "<p>Obviously field data is critical information, but candidly, a unanimously techy and wealthy audience can give almost any site \"good\" CWVs, while the same site might appear unresponsive on a low-end device. Field data doesn't help us answer, \"would the average person think this site performs well?\"</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:vw4wz2yi34amuicv5nzcumgy/app.bsky.feed.post/3loltnhydwc2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolsu7yo3k22",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/juanf.is/post/3loltnhydwc2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "juan ferreras",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/juanf.is",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:vw4wz2yi34amuicv5nzcumgy/bafkreie3aolqrpx7dqosoxete344rznyy4pi34ocan4ugrbdxh3njxbfyu"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T16:41:16.165Z",
			"content": "<p>Ohh I haven't thought of this in a long time.</p>\n<p>It accidentally reminded me of the old but goldie study from YouTube.</p>\n<p>TL;DR: improved perf =&gt; metrics actually worsened =&gt; folks who simply could not use YouTube before (+20mins of wait) at least now had a chance (~2mins) and started using it</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:prgzygmztzve2tfwtxy4ne7l/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolto7x33c2s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/app.bsky.feed.post/3lolsu7yo3k22",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/henrihelvetica.bsky.social/post/3lolto7x33c2s",
			"author": {
