			"date": "2025-05-07T16:46:54.318Z",
			"content": "<p>much like when we used to get clients who would say, \"well that's nice but we don't actually have any users on mobile\"</p>\n<p>Offering a poor mobile experience will continue to fulfill that prophecy 😅</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
