			},
			"date": "2025-05-07T16:55:09.672Z",
			"content": "<p>it's a good thing that the notion of \"good\" in metrics doesn't vary by device or connection speed because I think generally that's true of how people perceive a service's performance. Something either feels fast or it doesn't and it's our job to aim for that good sentiment for anyone who shows up</p>",
